# ============================================================
# Windows Password Spraying Detection
# ============================================================
#
# SOC L1 Detection | Splunk | Windows Security Event Logs
#
# Objective:
# Detect potential password spraying by identifying
# one source IP targeting multiple user accounts.
#
# Event ID:
# 4625 - Failed Logon
#
# Detection threshold:
# 5 or more unique users targeted by the same source IP.
#
# Password Spraying Pattern:
# One Source IP -> Multiple Users -> Failed Logons
#
# ============================================================

index=* signature_id=4625
| stats dc(user) as unique_users count as failed_attempts by src_ip
| where unique_users >= 5
| sort - unique_users
